            "text": "{\"findings\":[{\"tipo\":\"GPU\",\"causa_raiz\":\"Sobrecarga massiva na GPU registrando pico de 26.38ms (117 violacoes contra o teto de 16.7ms para 60 FPS). Com draw calls controlados em 904, o gargalo decorre de alto custo por pixel/fragment shader, fill-rate elevado (overdraw), resolucao de renderizacao nativa sem escalonamento dinamico e configuracoes de sombras/pos-processamento agressivas para a GTX 1650.\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"using UnityEngine;\\\\n\\\\npublic class AdaptiveQualityController : MonoBehaviour\\\\n{\\\\n    [Header(\\\"Alvos de Desempenho\\\")]\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float targetFrameTimeMs = 16.6f;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float toleranceMs = 1.5f;\\\\n\\\\n    [Header(\\\"Limites de Render Scale\\\")]\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float minRenderScale = 0.65f;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float maxRenderScale = 1.0f;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float scaleStep = 0.05f;\\\\n\\\\n    private float currentScale = 1.0f;\\\\n    private float accumulatedDeltaTime = 0f;\\\\n    private int frameCounter = 0;\\\\n    private const int EVALUATION_INTERVAL = 30;\\\\n\\\\n    private void Awake()\\\\n    {\\\\n        QualitySettings.vSyncCount = 0;\\\\n        Application.targetFrameRate = 60;\\\\n        ScalableBufferManager.ResizeBuffers(currentScale, currentScale);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    private void Update()\\\\n    {\\\\n        accumulatedDeltaTime += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;\\\\n        frameCounter++;\\\\n\\\\n        if (frameCounter \u003e= EVALUATION_INTERVAL)\\\\n        {\\\\n            float avgFrameTimeMs = (accumulatedDeltaTime / frameCounter) * 1000f;\\\\n            AdjustRenderingLoad(avgFrameTimeMs);\\\\n\\\\n            accumulatedDeltaTime = 0f;\\\\n            frameCounter = 0;\\\\n        }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    private void AdjustRenderingLoad(float avgFrameTimeMs)\\\\n    {\\\\n        if (avgFrameTimeMs \u003e targetFrameTimeMs + toleranceMs)\\\\n        {\\\\n            if (currentScale \u003e minRenderScale)\\\\n            {\\\\n                currentScale = Mathf.Max(minRenderScale, currentScale - scaleStep);\\\\n                ScalableBufferManager.ResizeBuffers(currentScale, currentScale);\\\\n            }\\\\n            else if (QualitySettings.shadowDistance \u003e 25f)\\\\n            {\\\\n                QualitySettings.shadowDistance = Mathf.Max(25f, QualitySettings.shadowDistance - 15f);\\\\n            }\\\\n        }\\\\n        else if (avgFrameTimeMs \u003c targetFrameTimeMs - toleranceMs)\\\\n        {\\\\n            if (QualitySettings.shadowDistance \u003c 60f)\\\\n            {\\\\n                QualitySettings.shadowDistance = Mathf.Min(60f, QualitySettings.shadowDistance + 5f);\\\\n            }\\\\n            else if (currentScale \u003c maxRenderScale)\\\\n            {\\\\n                currentScale = Mathf.Min(maxRenderScale, currentScale + scaleStep);\\\\n                ScalableBufferManager.ResizeBuffers(currentScale, currentScale);\\\\n            }\\\\n        }\\\\n    }\\\\n}\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"A placa de video (GPU) esta demorando 26.38ms para desenhar cada quadro, o que limita o jogo a cerca de 37 FPS em vez dos 60 FPS desejados (16.7ms). Esse script atua como um 'piloto automatico': ele mede o tempo medio dos quadros e, quando percebe que a GPU esta sobrecarregada, reduz sutilmente a resolucao interna de renderizacao (Dynamic Resolution) e a distancia das sombras. Isso alivia instantaneamente a placa de video sem exigir retrabalho visual dos artistas.\"},{\"tipo\":\"GC\",\"causa_raiz\":\"Alocacao continua de memoria gerenciada acumulando cerca de 33.7 KB por quadro, provocando disparos frequentes do Garbage Collector que causam pequenos engasgos (stuttering) e variacao de frametime na CPU.\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"using UnityEngine;\\\\n\\\\npublic class NonAllocPhysicsSystem : MonoBehaviour\\\\n{\\\\n    [SerializeField] private LayerMask targetMask;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private float scanRadius = 15f;\\\\n\\\\n    private readonly Collider[] hitBuffer = new Collider[64];\\\\n    private readonly RaycastHit[] raycastBuffer = new RaycastHit[16];\\\\n\\\\n    public int QuerySurroundings(Vector3 origin)\\\\n    {\\\\n        int hitCount = Physics.OverlapSphereNonAlloc(origin, scanRadius, hitBuffer, targetMask);\\\\n        for (int i = 0; i \u003c hitCount; i++)\\\\n        {\\\\n            ProcessTarget(hitBuffer[i]);\\\\n        }\\\\n        return hitCount;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    public bool CheckSightLine(Vector3 origin, Vector3 direction, float distance, out RaycastHit nearestHit)\\\\n    {\\\\n        int hitCount = Physics.RaycastNonAlloc(origin, direction, raycastBuffer, distance, targetMask);\\\\n        if (hitCount \u003e 0)\\\\n        {\\\\n            nearestHit = raycastBuffer[0];\\\\n            return true;\\\\n        }\\\\n        nearestHit = default;\\\\n        return false;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    private void ProcessTarget(Collider targetCollider)\\\\n    {\\\\n        // Logica de processamento sem instanciacoes de memoria temporaria\\\\n    }\\\\n}\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"Em C#, metodos como Physics.RaycastAll ou instanciar listas a cada frame criam dados descartaveis na memoria RAM. Quando essa memoria enche, o Garbage Collector congela o jogo para limpar o lixo. Trocamos metodos que geram lixo por versoes NonAlloc com arrays pre-alocados (reutilizaveis), eliminando completamente as pausas de coleta de memoria.\"}],\"dicas_level_design\":null}",
